        "code": "return get_parent().ForceTestState(\"piece=1;x=7;y=18;rot=0;board=....##....|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........|..........\")"
      },
      "note": "test hook: the two cells the next O-piece is born on (4,0) and (5,0) are already occupied, and the row is NOT full (so no line clear can rescue it) -- the spawn must end the game. Defect T-3 of the first round: a FULL spawn row was used, the line clear ran before the spawn check, and the game correctly refused to end"
